@startuml
title A-UAV Mission State Machine (PX4)

State Preparation {
  State PreFlight
  State MissionPathFollowing
  State AbfangAreaReached
  State Hover
}
State Execution {
  State CameraAlignment
  State TargetConsensus
  State Endphase_ZI
  State InterceptFlight
}

State AbortMission {
  State Abort
  State ReturnToBase
  State Landed
}
[*] --> PreFlight

Preparation --> Abort : Abort Mission Command (CS)
Execution --> Abort : Abort Mission Command (CS)

PreFlight --> MissionPathFollowing : Mission Start Command (CS)

MissionPathFollowing --> MissionPathFollowing : Receive updated\nAbfangbereich (CS)
MissionPathFollowing --> AbfangAreaReached : Enter Abfangbereich

AbfangAreaReached --> Hover : Hold Position
Hover --> CameraAlignment : Z-UAVs detected (RADAR/CS)

CameraAlignment --> TargetConsensus : Exchange status\nwith other A-UAVs
TargetConsensus --> TargetConsensus : Consensus not reached
TargetConsensus --> Endphase_ZI : Consensus reached

Endphase_ZI --> InterceptFlight : Z-UAV identified\n(200m camera ID)
InterceptFlight --> InterceptFlight : Course correction\n(400m detection)
InterceptFlight --> [*] : Z-UAV intercepted


Abort --> ReturnToBase : CS Command: Abort Mission
ReturnToBase --> Landed : Touchdown
Landed --> [*]

@enduml
